# Line endings: LF everywhere, on every OS, regardless of core.autocrlf.
#
# Why (verified 2026-09-30): a fresh clone on Windows with core.autocrlf=true
# checked scripts/audit-gate.mjs out with CRLF, and vitest then failed to import
# it (SyntaxError) - 10 tests silently dropped from the run. The same file with
# LF passes. CI on Linux never sees CRLF, so this only bit Windows checkouts.
# Git already stores every text file as LF; this makes the checkout match.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.thumbnail binary
